  "body": "Designed with modern family living at its heart, this generous 219sqm (approx.) single-level residence rests on a substantial 627sqm freehold section. Combining flexible living, seamless indoor-outdoor flow, and rare parking potential for a boat or camper, this home effortlessly caters to every stage of family life.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a welcoming separate lounge-the perfect sanctuary for quiet evenings or welcoming guests. Further in, the home expands into an impressive high-ceiling open-plan hub where the kitchen, dining, and family area connect effortlessly. Culinary enthusiasts will love the sleek kitchen, featuring a generous central island, quality fittings, and extensive cabinetry, all serviced by a nearby guest powder room.\r\n\r\nGlass sliders open out to an expansive covered deck, allowing year-round alfresco dining and effortless weekend entertaining. Beyond, the landscaped, fully fenced lawn provides a secure playground for children and pets alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is smartly configured: the master suite occupies its own private wing, complete with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Three additional double bedrooms are serviced by a full family bathroom, while a dedicated study nook toward the rear offers an ideal, distraction-free work-from-home or homework zone.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nFreehold 627sqm section with approx. 219sqm single-level floor plan\r\n\r\n4 double bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms (including master ensuite & guest powder room)\r\n\r\nDual living zones plus a dedicated work-from-home study nook\r\n\r\nHigh-stud ceilings enhancing light and scale across the main open-plan living area\r\n\r\nChef's kitchen with large entertainer's island and ample storage\r\n\r\nWeather-protected deck overlooking a private, landscaped backyard\r\n\r\nDouble internal-access garage plus dedicated space for boat or trailer parking\r\n\r\nPrime position: moments from Butler Stoney Park, motorway ramps, Millwater shops, and Silverdale retail\r\n\r\nA complete family package inside and out. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing or join us at the open home!\r\n\r\nAll Conjunctionals are welcome from day 1.",
